{"t":"ICE","made":"2026-11-26 02:57","name":"Intercontinental Exchange, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Financial Data & Stock Exchanges","employees":12842,"hq":"Atlanta, GA, United States","website":"https://www.ice.com","summary_en":"Intercontinental Exchange, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides technology and data to financial institutions, corporations, and government entities in the United States, the United Kingdom, the European Union, Canada, Asia Pacific, and the Middle East. It operates through three segments: Exchanges, Fixed Income and Data Services, and Mortgage Technology. The Exchanges segment operates regulated marketplace technology for the listing, trading, and clearing of an array of derivatives contracts and financial securities, such as commodities, interest rates, foreign exchange and equities, and corporate and exchange-traded funds, as well as data and connectivity services related to its exchanges and clearing houses. The Fixed Income and Data Services segment provides fixed income pricing, reference data, indices, analytics, and execution services, as well as global CDS clearing and multi-asset class data delivery technology. The Mortgage Technology segment offers a technology platform that provides customers comprehensive and digital workflow tools to address inefficiencies and mitigate risks that exist in the U.S. residential mortgage market life cycle from application through closing, servicing, and the secondary market. The company was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Intercontinental Exchange, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국, 영국, 유럽 연합, 캐나다, 아시아 태평양 및 중동의 금융 기관, 기업 및 정부 기관에 기술과 데이터를 제공합니다. 거래소, 고정 수입 및 데이터 서비스, 모기지 기술의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 거래소 부문은 상품, 이자율, 외환 및 주식, 기업 및 상장 거래 자금과 같은 다양한 파생 상품 계약 및 금융 증권의 상장, 거래 및 청산을 위한 규제된 시장 기술은 물론 거래소 및 어음 교환소와 관련된 데이터 및 연결 서비스를 운영합니다. 고정 수입 및 데이터 서비스 부문은 고정 수입 가격 책정, 참조 데이터, 지수, 분석 및 실행 서비스는 물론 글로벌 CDS 청산 및 다중 자산 클래스 데이터 전달 기술을 제공합니다. 모기지 기술 부문은 고객에게 신청부터 마감, 서비스 및 2차 시장까지 미국 주택 모기지 시장 수명 주기에 존재하는 비효율성을 해결하고 위험을 완화하기 위한 포괄적인 디지털 워크플로 도구를 제공하는 기술 플랫폼을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 2000년에 설립되었으며 조지아주 애틀랜타에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":176.5499,"mcap":98666397696.0,"pe":24.05312,"fpe":19.740713,"peg":1.9268,"ps":9.042008,"pb":3.2949479,"ev_ebitda":17.262,"div":1.19,"beta":0.844,"hi52":181.38,"lo52":121.79},"fin":{"rev":10912000000.0,"rev_g":0.147,"eps_g":0.176,"gross":1.0,"op":0.53235,"net":0.38141,"roe":0.14399,"fcf":299375008.0,"cash":936000000.0,"debt":23989000192.0,"de":80.025,"eps":7.34,"feps":8.94344},"own":{"short":0.0111,"inst":0.97287005,"insider":0.00828},"analyst":{"n":15,"mean":193.53333,"median":192.0,"high":245.0,"low":167.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.875,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":8,"hold":3,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":8,"hold":2,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":5,"buy":9,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":9,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":182.0,"priorPriceTarget":167.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":167.0,"priorPriceTarget":160.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":194.0,"priorPriceTarget":189.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Keefe, Bruyette & Woods","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":190.0,"priorPriceTarget":180.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-14","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises